{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "e2ba8475-7b56-4b8c-986c-dfc588523c9a",
		"name": "Fitness Microservices System (6 Services)",
		"description": "Collection for testing the complete Fitness Microservices System with 6 business services and Keycloak OAuth2 security through the API Gateway.\n\n**ORDEN DE EJECUCIÓN:**\n1. Get Token → guarda jwt_token automáticamente\n2. Crear Usuario → devuelve idUsuario (usar en siguientes requests)\n3. Crear Membresía → requiere idUsuario válido\n4. Crear Rutina → requiere idUsuario válido\n5. Asignar Ejercicio → requiere idRutina válido\n6. Registrar Progreso → requiere idUsuario válido\n7. Registrar Nutrición → requiere idUsuario válido",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Keycloak - Get Token",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
							"if (jsonData.access_token) {",
							"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"jwt_token\", jsonData.access_token);",
							"    console.log(\"✅ JWT Token guardado correctamente.\");",
							"} else {",
							"    console.log(\"❌ No se obtuvo token. Verifica credenciales.\");",
							"}"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [],
				"body": {
					"mode": "urlencoded",
					"urlencoded": [
						{
							"key": "client_id",
							"value": "fitness-client",
							"type": "text"
						},
						{
							"key": "client_secret",
							"value": "fitness-client-secret",
							"type": "text"
						},
						{
							"key": "grant_type",
							"value": "password",
							"type": "text"
						},
						{
							"key": "username",
							"value": "admin",
							"type": "text"
						},
						{
							"key": "password",
							"value": "admin123",
							"type": "text"
						}
					]
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "http://localhost:8180/realms/fitness-realm/protocol/openid-connect/token",
					"protocol": "http",
					"host": ["localhost"],
					"port": "8180",
					"path": ["realms", "fitness-realm", "protocol", "openid-connect", "token"]
				}
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "2. Usuario - Crear Usuario",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
							"if (jsonData.idUsuario) {",
							"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"usuario_id\", jsonData.idUsuario);",
							"    console.log(\"✅ Usuario creado con id: \" + jsonData.idUsuario);",
							"}"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"auth": {
					"type": "bearer",
					"bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{jwt_token}}", "type": "string"}]
				},
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [],
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n  \"nombres\": \"Carlos\",\n  \"apellidos\": \"Laynes\",\n  \"correo\": \"carlos.laynes@mail.com\",\n  \"dni\": \"12345678\",\n  \"password\": \"pass1234\",\n  \"telefono\": \"987654321\",\n  \"rol\": \"USER\"\n}",
					"options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "http://localhost:8080/api/usuarios",
					"protocol": "http", "host": ["localhost"], "port": "8080",
					"path": ["api", "usuarios"]
				}
			},
			"response": []
		},
